          "path": "_m/g/c/s/n/donaghadee-lifeboat-station-wp/rnli-mobile-training-unit-at-d.jpg",
          "filename": "RNLI Mobile Training Unit at Donaghadee - geograph.org.uk - 378823.jpg",
          "caption": "RNLI Mobile Training Unit at Donaghadee \nThe days when lifeboats were manned by gnarled fishermen with a lifetimes knowledge of the sea are gone.  Many volunteers have little or no seagoing experience.  The RNLI places considerable importance on training  one example of which is the Mobile Training Unit which allows crews to be trained in specialist matters without having to visit Poole.  One of the MTUs vans is seen outside Donaghadee lifeboat station  see 309984.",
          "alt": "RNLI Mobile Training Unit at Donaghadee \nThe days when lifeboats were manned by gnarled fishermen with a lifetimes knowledge of the sea are gone.  Many volunteers have little or no seagoing experience.  The RNLI places considerable importance on training  one example of which is the Mobile Training Unit which allows crews to be trained in specialist matters without having to visit Poole.  One of the MTUs vans is seen outside Donaghadee lifeboat station  see 309984.",
